sequenceDiagram
    participant ProducerService as Other Microservice
    participant RabbitMQ
    participant FileService
    participant S3Repository
    participant AWSS3 as AWS S3

    %% Step 1: Event Trigger
    ProducerService->>RabbitMQ: Publish "upload_request" message<br/>to storage-requests queue

    %% Step 2: FileService consumes event
    RabbitMQ-->>FileService: Deliver upload_request message
    FileService->>S3Repository: uploadFile(bucket, key, file)
    S3Repository->>AWSS3: Upload object to S3 bucket
    AWSS3-->>S3Repository: Upload successful
    S3Repository-->>FileService: Return success

    %% Step 3: Publish completion event
    FileService->>RabbitMQ: Publish "file_uploaded" event<br/>to storage-events queue
    RabbitMQ-->>ProducerService: Notify or log event